# AWS GuardDuty Detector Deleted Or Updated | T1685, T1685.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/cloud/aws/cloudtrail/aws_cloudtrail_guardduty_detector_deleted_or_updated.yml
eventSource="guardduty.amazonaws.com" (eventName="DeleteDetector" OR (eventName="UpdateDetector" requestParameters.enable="false")) (errorCode="Success" OR NOT errorCode=*)
